OL,3,GNEWSAResidents use own cars to block
OL,4,A'bully' developer
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaured Kalari, who lives on the estate,
OL,7,Fsaid the developer's approach was "some
OL,8,Fof the most odious" he had witnessed.
OL,9,FThe developer, Owl Homes, was contacted
OL,10,Fby the BBC on several occasions for a
OL,11,Fresponse.
